# The returning ability looks for the card in the graveyard where it died. Bot2 Bolts the Innocence on turn 2 and, with the death trigger on the
# stack, exiles it with Ghost Vacuum. A card that has changed zones is a new object (CR 400.7), so the trigger finds nothing to return: the
# Innocence stays in exile.

